  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"project.callback_address.set\",\"title\":\"项目/营销成本保障状态变动\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/unknown_path/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"capability_summary\":\"为订阅任务设置回调地址，用于接收项目成本保障状态变动通知推送。关联接口：https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/cost_protect_status/get/\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"project.cost_protect_status.get\",\"title\":\"\",\"path\":\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/cost_protect_status/get/\",\"relation\":\"关联接口\",\"reason\":\"文档中提及的关联接口\"}]}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-96rXS7Vq\" id=\"h346b9f0-96rXS7Vq\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-mKoEkYSX\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KjrAAnNk\" id=\"h346b9f0-KjrAAnNk\">关联API接口</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-KD8lDKJm\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/cost_protect_status/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/project/cost_protect_status/get/</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hMfo80cn\" id=\"h346b9f0-hMfo80cn\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-2WObinSo\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-FMppVkSV\" id=\"h346b9f0-FMppVkSV\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"spitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1722481732805646\"> 【X-Open-Signature签名校验】</a></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-o5VW80lw\" id=\"h346b9f0-o5VW80lw\">请求参数</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-mQLl5MeU\" id=\"h490b8bf-mQLl5MeU\">基础信息</h2><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"spitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息ID,唯一标识</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅任务ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">service_label</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅服务类型<br/>允许值: `compensate.status.realtime` 获取项目成本保障状态变动通知推送</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息实际产生时间，毫秒时间戳</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">timestamp</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">毫秒时间戳，本条消息实际推送时间，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">nonce</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随机数，和timestamp组合防重放，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_relation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账号对应关系，包含所有的授权关系</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">core_user_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">用户授权账号</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">advertiser_id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">事件类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Ll82MCk4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8eS0geEA\"><code>ADVERTISER</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">content</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">user_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">触发事件的用户id，营销场景即为advertiser_id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">project_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">项目id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">营销id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">compensate_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">项目 / 营销 成本保障状态 枚举值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-37k0mTjF\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WNIGOncG\"><code>CONFIRMING</code> 成本保障确认中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HBfGJd1S\"><code>DEFAULT</code> 无成本保障状态，表示该项目/营销不支持成本保障，此时在巨量营销升级版平台页面上也不会展示相关标志</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nmCEDBJV\"><code>ENDED</code> 成本保障已结束</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0DfNNnF1\"><code>INVALID</code> 成本保障已失效</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Rqi0YSJm\"><code>IN_EFFECT</code> 成本保障生效中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qflAQpTL\"><code>PAID</code> 成本保障已到账</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">compensate_invalid_reasons</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vJ6jje7A\">项目 / 营销 成本保障失效原因，仅当compensate_status = INVALID 时进行该参数信息的下发</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-2rSICGS5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Hf4XCMq6\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUD_CHANGES</span></code>单日修改定向超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aSQbvfcL\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BID_CHANGES</span></code>单日修改出价超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rBcAI6lP\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ROI_CHANGES</span></code>单日修改roi_goal超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-wStiN1hp\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ANTI_SPAM</span></code>命中反作弊</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-s9Kb8JBb\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">BID_TYPE_EXPIRED</span></code>选择的出价产品暂不支持成本保障</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lSLORFwk\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">MANUAL_JUDGE_SPAM</span></code>有异常的作弊行为</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-732DiEqr\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUD_BID_CHANGES</span></code>单日修改定向/出价超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gCxTmSwF\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">AUD_ROI_CHANGES</span></code>单日修改定向/ROI目标超过2次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GEzPuXkw\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ACCOUNT_TRANSFER_APPLICATION </span></code>申请转户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ol58XsxZ\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">STOP_REJECT_DELETE</span></code>投放期间出现暂停、拒审或删除操作（仅针对简单投项目进行返回）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5PMJa45X\"><code>STOP_REJECT_DELETE</code>投放期间出现暂停、拒审或删除操作--仅对于简单投0转赔付场景有该枚举值</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">compensate_end_reasons</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9NCSEVxy\">成本保障结束原因，仅当compensate_status = <code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ENDED</span></code></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Vgi7ukJ0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QtMq2aE4\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">UN_OBERCOST</span></code></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mLpQy5hO\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ROI_REAL_EXPECTED</span></code>实际roi大于目标roi的80%</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-l0z0mtt0\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">CONVERT_UNDER_THRESHOLD</span></code>转化数没有达到门槛</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2RMDU1v2\"><code><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">CURRENCY_PRECISION</span></code>赔付金额小于0.01元</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hzAUr6uj\"><code>CONVERT_ZERO_OR_COST </code> 转化数为0或无消耗--仅对于简单投0转赔付场景有该枚举值</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">compensate_amount</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-W9DbnfDf\">赔付金额（元），最多2位小数</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-gmDI1UJU\" id=\"h346b9f0-gmDI1UJU\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22